      "description": "Folder tabs on the green shell; the current tab joins the wall and carries an orange dot.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-shell\"><a class=\"ds-tab\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#\"><b>Map</b><small>Where cash stands</small></a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\"><b>Sketch</b><small>Trends</small></a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\"><b>Decide</b><small>What-if</small></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-shell{font-family:'Schibsted Grotesk',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;gap:4px;background:#173A2D;padding:14px 16px 0}.ds-tab{display:grid;line-height:1.25;text-decoration:none;color:#B5CCBF;padding:9px 16px 12px;border-radius:9px 9px 0 0}.ds-tab b{font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px}.ds-tab small{font-size:12px;opacity:.85}.ds-tab:hover{color:#EEF3EF;background:#21503E}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid #D9731F;outline-offset:2px}.ds-tab[aria-current=page]{background:#F4F6F3;color:#173A2D}.ds-tab[aria-current=page] b::before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#D9731F;margin-right:7px;vertical-align:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticker Dots",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "",
      "description": "The state language: solid = actual, ring = forecast; colour = state.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-dots\"><i class=\"ds-dot\"></i><i class=\"ds-dot warn\"></i><i class=\"ds-dot crit\"></i><i class=\"ds-dot slate\"></i><i class=\"ds-dot ring\"></i></span> <span class=\"ds-tag\"><i class=\"ds-dot ring\"></i>Forecast</span>",
      "css": ".ds-dots{display:inline-flex;gap:4px;align-items:center}.ds-dot{display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:#2E7D4F;box-sizing:border-box}.ds-dot.warn{background:#B98500}.ds-dot.crit{background:#C23B32}.ds-dot.slate{background:#6A7790}.ds-dot.ring{background:transparent;border:2.4px solid #D9731F}.ds-tag{font-family:'Schibsted Grotesk',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:#A8530F}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Watch-list Note",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "watch-note",
      "description": "A white note on the wall: 1-3 urgency dots, exact amount, title, note, Actual/Forecast tag.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-note\"><span class=\"ds-top\"><span class=\"ds-d\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><b>&minus;&#8288;&#8377;7,17,154</b></span><span class=\"ds-t\">Plan runs out of cash in November 2026</span><span class=\"ds-n\">November budget against cash today; nothing expected in</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-note{font-family:'Schibsted Grotesk',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;gap:4px;width:320px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#17221D;border:1px solid #D8DED8;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px 13px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(23,34,29,.06),0 4px 14px rgba(23,34,29,.05);cursor:pointer;font-size:15px}.ds-note:hover{border-color:#33403A}.ds-note:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid #D9731F;outline-offset:2px}.ds-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.ds-d{display:inline-flex;gap:4px}.ds-d i{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;box-sizing:border-box;border:2.4px solid #C23B32}.ds-t{font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.35}.ds-n{color:#56635C;font-size:12.5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Show-working Figure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "",
      "description": "Every figure is a button with a dotted underline that opens its working.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-fig\"><button class=\"ds-w\">&#8377;1,92,490.53</button><span class=\"ds-l\">Cash at 31 Oct 2026</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-fig{font-family:'Schibsted Grotesk',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;gap:2px;padding:13px 0}.ds-w{all:unset;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1.2;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:underline dotted rgba(23,34,29,.35);text-underline-offset:4px;text-decoration-thickness:1.5px;color:#17221D}.ds-w:hover{text-decoration-color:#D9731F}.ds-w:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid #D9731F;outline-offset:2px}.ds-l{color:#56635C;font-size:12.5px}"
    },
    {
